here\'s no mention of exceptions or other factors that might affect this conclusion. So, it\'s definitely false.\n</think>.\n\nThe Legend of Zelda sold more than one million copies, which means it meets the condition to be in the Top 10. Therefore, the statement that it\'s not in the Top 10 is false. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
