g is about the settlement, not the islands.\n\nI don\'t see any information that would make this uncertain. The context clearly states that Barutin is named after the settlement, not the islands. So, the answer should be false.\n</think>.\n\nThe statement is false because Barutin is named after a settlement, not the islands in Antarctica. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
