for a club, specifically Nautico.\n\nI don\'t see any information suggesting that Ailton Silva doesn\'t play for any football club. The context explicitly states he plays for Nautico. Therefore, the statement is false.\n</think>.\n\nThe statement is false because Ailton Silva plays for Nautico, a football club. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
