 lot of her time eating and catching up with friends in the campus dining halls.\"\n   - From the analysis, Mary is not a picky eater. Therefore, the first part of the statement (\"Mary either is not a picky eater\") is true.\n   - Since the first part is true, the entire statement is true regardless of the second part.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
