e cities in Montana as Butte, Helena, and Missoula. So that\'s three cities. Then it talks about White Sulphur Springs being in the same state as Butte, which is Montana, so that\'s another city in Montana. But the question is about Missoula, which is already listed as a city in Montana.\n\nSo the statement "Montana is home to the city of Missoula" must be true because Missoula is explicitly listed as one of the cities in Montana. There\'s no information that contradicts this, so it\'s definitely true.\n</think>.\n\nThe statement is true because Missoula is explicitly listed as a city in Montana. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
